{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01488","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞二首 一 · 杨衡","name":"舞曲歌辞 白紵辞二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉缨翠佩杂轻罗，香汗微渍朱颜酡，爲君起唱白紵歌。\n清声褭云思繁多，凝笳哀琴时相和。\n金壶半倾芳夜促，梁尘霏霏暗红烛。\n令君安坐听终曲，坠叶飘花难再复。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}